 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【阿根廷公布世界杯名单】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a18b6ddbad50native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷世界杯参赛名单：梅西领衔 恩佐小蜘蛛在列 马斯坦托诺落选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290544046309_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290544046309_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290544046309_1280.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">北京时间5月29日早晨，阿根廷国家队公布了参加本届世界杯的参赛名单。梅西领衔，阿尔瓦雷斯、恩佐、帕斯等人均在列，马斯坦托诺、布恩迪亚、塞内西等人落选。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a18b8e805342native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">创足坛新纪录！梅西领衔阿根廷名单，将参加个人生涯第六届世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290607508314.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290607508314_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290607508314_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">阿根廷公布了参加本届世界杯的26人名单，梅西领衔，他将迎来个人生涯参加的第六届世界杯。</span></p><p><strong>【转会和其他新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a1868b131b92native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：阿莱格里将接替孔蒂成为那不勒斯主帅，签约两年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.74" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290010165000_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.74" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.74" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290010165000_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260529/202605290010165000_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">记者罗马诺以Here we go确认，阿莱格里将执教那不勒斯，将接替孔蒂！阿莱格里不久前才从米兰离任。据多家意媒表示，阿莱格里将与那不勒斯签约两年。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a18913a5d54cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：小蜘蛛正式告知马竞自己想离开！巴萨是他的明确首要目标</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a14218318413.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a14218318413.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260525/6a14218318413.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">名记罗马诺更新个人播客节目，谈到阿尔瓦雷斯的未来相关情况。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a1890b359860native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马竞人士谈小蜘蛛传闻：他是非卖品！巴萨展现了小球队的姿态</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d051e48d7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d051e48d7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a16d051e48d7.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">马竞方面借《马卡报》《阿斯报》的平台回应了近期巴萨、阿尔瓦雷斯的传闻。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a186bc84b050native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：巴萨即将签下B席！他们击败了其他所有对球员感兴趣的球队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.42" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260305/69a98c3b2d4a4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.42" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.42" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260305/69a98c3b2d4a4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260305/69a98c3b2d4a4.jpg"> </div><p>据意大利记者隆加里报道，巴萨即将签下前曼城队长B席；巴萨击败了其他所有对B席感兴趣的球队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-29/6a18813ad48fcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">二选一！每体：如果巴萨签下B席，拉什福德将不可能留在巴萨</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/69df545877405.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/69df545877405.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260415/69df545877405.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">每日体育报撰文，分析了目前巴萨引援面临的问题：B席还是拉什福德，巴萨面临一个二选一的情况。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/6a185770a537dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴媒：巴西队决定暂不除名内马尔，给15天恢复期并希望小组赛复出</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.37" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250722/687ee86fd64b1.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.37" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.37" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250722/687ee86fd64b1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250722/687ee86fd64b1.jpg"> </div><p><a href="http://巴西媒体ge.globo" target="_blank" weibo="" mode=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">巴西媒体ge.globo</span></a><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">消息，巴西足协当前决定在名单中保留内马尔，并寄希望于他能在小组赛阶段复出。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-05-28/6a1856a4b8f5fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">BBC：曼联3500万镑签埃德松很快完成 同时可能对琼阿梅尼采取行动</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a170ab7566ba.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a170ab7566ba.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260527/6a170ab7566ba.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据BBC报道，曼联3500万英镑签下亚特兰大中场埃德松的转会很快就会完成。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2